<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed lower in quiet trading Monday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average fell 11.54 points to 6,549.37.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite fell 0.68 to 397.42.</p>
<p>The average price per share fell 7 cents.</p>
<p>Winners beat losers 1,402 to 1,065.</p>
<p>Volume was 339 million shares compared with 252.5 million Friday.</p>
